### Objective Function:
- Minimize the total working hours: \[Z = 9x_{IA} + 4x_{IB} + 3x_{IC} + 7x_{ID} + 4x_{IIA} + 6x_{IIB} + 5x_{IIC} + 6x_{IID} + 5x_{IIIA} + 4x_{IIIB} + 7x_{IIIC} + 5x_{IIID} + 7x_{IVA} + 5x_{IVB} + 2x_{IVC} + 3x_{IVD} + 10x_{VA} + 6x_{VB} + 7x_{VC} + 4x_{VD}\]

