2. Repair duration constraints: \[i + p \leq j \Rightarrow \delta_{ij} = 1, \forall i, j\]
   - This ensures that if slow repair is used in stage \(i\) for use in stage \(j\), then \(i + p \leq j\).
3. Repair duration constraints for fast repair: \[i + q \leq j \Rightarrow \delta_{ij} = 0, \forall i, j\]
