### Objective Function:
- Maximize the number of completed products: \[Z = \sum_{i \in \{A, B, C, D\}}\sum_{j=1}^{3} \left( \frac{x_{ij}}{\text{Productivity}_{ij}} \right)\]
  - This function calculates the total number of completed products based on the number of hours allocated to each component in each workshop and the productivity of each component.

### Constraints:
